        direction LR
        na((a)) --> nb((b)) --> nd((d))
        na --> nc((c)) --> nd
        nd --> nf((f))
        nnote["d is RE-EXPANDED when c's path arrives later<br/>-> f and everything downstream is OVER-COUNTED"]:::bug
